            Our test evaluates non-verbal fluid reasoning using 3-Parameter Logistic Item Response Theory on progressive items. It provides an educational screening estimate of reasoning ability, but is not a clinical diagnostic instrument like a full WAIS-IV or SB-V examination administered by a licensed psychologist.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-7 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 transition-all open:bg-zinc-50 dark:open:bg-zinc-900/70 shadow-2xs">
