            The assessment consists of 24 psychometrically calibrated items evenly distributed across the 4 core CHC cognitive domains: 6 Fluid Reasoning (Gf), 6 Visual-Spatial Processing (Gv), 6 Quantitative Reasoning (Gq), and 6 Verbal Comprehension (Gc) items, scaling progressively in difficulty.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-7 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 transition-all open:bg-zinc-50 dark:open:bg-zinc-900/70 shadow-2xs">
